<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-family:"Courier New";display:none;
mso-hide:all'>.fi<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal>Each block can also interface, informally, with declarations
in the surrounding block. This is referred to in Pascaline terminology as the
&quot;side&quot; interface:</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='display:none;mso-hide:all'>.nf<o:p></o:p></span></p>

