style='mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>fn</span></span>,
the permissions in the set <span class=ReferenceChar0><span style='mso-bidi-font-family:
"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>p</span></span> are set true
for the file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;page-break-after:avoid'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;page-break-after:avoid'>Exceptions:
StringNil</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='page-break-after:avoid'>procedure resoper(fn:
[p]string; p: permset);</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='page-break-after:avoid'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;page-break-after:avoid'>Reset
group permissions. Given a file by name <span class=ReferenceChar0><span
style='mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>fn</span></span>,
the permissions in the set <span class=ReferenceChar0><span style='mso-bidi-font-family:
"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>p</span></span> are set false
for the file.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;page-break-after:avoid'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;page-break-after:avoid'>Exceptions:
StringNil</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='page-break-after:avoid'>procedure seterr(e: integer);</p>

