<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;page-break-after:avoid'>Returns
the number of buttons on a given mouse <span class=ReferenceChar0><span
style='mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>m</span></span>
in output surface file <span class=ReferenceChar0><span style='mso-bidi-font-family:
"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>f</span></span>.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='page-break-after:avoid'>function joystick[(var f:
text)]: joynum;</p>

