</span>(dmoun:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>               </span>mouhan;<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>   </span>{ mouse handle }</p>

<p class=code style='page-break-after:avoid'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>                  </span>dmoubn:<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>              </span>moubut);<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  </span>{ button number }</p>

<p class=code style='page-break-after:avoid'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>      </span>etjoyba:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>  
</span>(ajoyn:<span style='mso-spacerun:yes'>               </span>joyhan;<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>   </span>{ joystick number }</p>

<p class=code style='page-break-after:avoid'><span
