<p class=code style='page-break-after:avoid'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>                  </span>joypx, joypy, joypz:
integer); { joystick</p>

<p class=code style='page-break-after:avoid'><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>                                                 
</span><span style='mso-spacerun:yes'> </span>coordinates }</p>

