<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan lines-together;
page-break-after:avoid'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan lines-together'>If
the user cancels, a null string is returned (a string with zero length, not a
nil pointer).</p>

<p class=MsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='page-break-after:avoid'>procedure queryfont([var f:
text;] var fc, s, fr, fg, fb, br, bg, bb: integer; var effect: qfteffects);</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='page-break-after:avoid'>procedure queryfont([var f:
text;] var fc, s: integer; var fcl, bcl: color; var effect: qfteffects);</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='page-break-after:avoid'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan lines-together;
page-break-after:avoid'>Creates a query font dialog. The dialog &quot;flows
through&quot; to set its parameters. When called, <span class=referenceChar><span
style='mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>fc</span></span>
contains the font code, <span class=referenceChar><span style='mso-bidi-font-family:
"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>s</span></span> contains the
size, <span class=referenceChar><span style='mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";
mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>fr</span></span>, <span class=referenceChar><span
style='mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>fg</span></span>
and <span class=referenceChar><span style='mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";
mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>fb</span></span> contain the foreground red,
green and blue colors, <span class=referenceChar><span style='mso-bidi-font-family:
"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>br</span></span>, <span
class=referenceChar><span style='mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";
mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>bg</span></span>, <span class=referenceChar><span
style='mso-bidi-font-family:"Times New Roman";mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi'>bb</span></span>
contains the background red, green and blue colors, and effect contains a set
of font effects. These values are used to initalize the dialog defaults. The
user then sets any or all of the parameters, and the results are copied back to
the same output parameters. The dialog is presented to the front of the desktop
stacking order, and the program holds until the dialog is complete.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan lines-together;
page-break-after:avoid'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:36.0pt;mso-pagination:widow-orphan lines-together'>If
the dialog does not have a particular feature such as color set ability or one
or more effects, the input for that parameter is simply copied to the output.</p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:115%'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>

