<p class=code style='page-break-after:avoid'>CAN<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>       </span>Cancel</p>

<p class=code style='page-break-after:avoid'>EM<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>        </span>End of Medium</p>

<p class=code style='page-break-after:avoid'>SUB<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>   </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span>Substitute</p>

<p class=code style='page-break-after:avoid'>ESC<span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>    </span><span
style='mso-spacerun:yes'>   </span>Escape</p>

<p class=code style='page-break-after:avoid'>FS<span
